<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns three secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns three secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed three credit auctions in the secondary market, whereby it sought to inject 3.765 billion pesos.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS    TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.382  bln pesos   8 days    32.00 pct</p>
<p>    1.383  bln pesos   4 days    31.62 pct</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos   1 day     31.24 pct</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
